cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite this version and the original PDB structure publications."
title: "MacroCycle Dataset: From PDB Structures to a Computation-Ready Benchmark"
type: dataset
version: 0.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
authors:
  - name: "MacroCycle Benchmark contributors"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A curated benchmark of 1,861 experimentally determined
  protein-macrocycle binding modes spanning 1,570 unique unprotonated
  macrocycle structures, with audited reference ligand bond orders,
  computationally prepared and audited pH 7.4 protonated forms, protein
  structures, SMILES, and metadata.
keywords:
  - macrocycle
  - cyclic peptide
  - conformational sampling
  - molecular docking
  - structural bioinformatics
  - benchmark dataset
